//
// @file helpers.rho
// @brief Keeper helpers as rules: their names, the environment a helper may be given, its definition as JSON, and its state read from the keeper's answer.
//
// @module mesh.domain.helpers
// @project mesh
// @author Aurel Miron
// @date 2026-11-20
